# Rust / KeyVault

- Crypto changes only in `crates/vault-core`; never log secrets or master passwords.
- Zero-knowledge: server stores ciphertext blobs only.
- Run `cargo fmt`, `cargo clippy`, `cargo test` for Rust changes.
- Extension/desktop sync: preserve existing native messaging contract.